iption":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-21T00:29:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T19:20:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nFound in the 4.7.2.stable version.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.7.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M3 - Apple M3 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI was just about to experiment with CodeEdit when I received multiple errors the moment I ran the project.\nNo matter what changes I did to CodeEdit, the errors just wouldn't stop appearing when running the project.\nThis problem only occurs when using the Compatibility renderer, so the others are fine for CodeEdit.\nEven so, I think this is worth reporting.\nIf you're curious on what these errors are, check the steps to reproduce below.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a6b4e78-6818-4251-aaa7-913166e7d821\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Bug Showcase.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32447538/Bug.Showcase.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123664/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123664/time